        526.869873046875,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "The current recommendations are based on the evaluation of data for the tests that were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        527.0005493164062,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "included in the present evaluation. The findings cannot be extrapolated to other brand-specific",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.968103408813477,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        497.0206298828125,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "tests; also, any new in-class technologies will need to be specifically evaluated by WHO.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        526.9260864257812,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines are disseminated through the WHO Global TB Programme (WHO/GTB) listservs to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        526.6004028320312,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "WHO regional offices, Member States, the Stop TB Partnership and other stakeholders (e.g. the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979731559753418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        526.8540649414062,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "Global Laboratory Initiative and the TB Supranational Reference Laboratory Network); they are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977176666259766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        527.3023071289062,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "also published on the websites of the WHO/GTB and Global Laboratory Initiative. The updated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98138427734375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.16522216796875,
        526.7169189453125,
        199.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "policy is incorporated into the WHO TB Knowledge Sharing Platform – an online reference",
