      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        337.7768249511719,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "resource for global TB policies and derivative products.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.1347198486328,
        188.20848083496094,
        243.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41439819335938,
        268.6444091796875,
        512.37939453125,
        281.55841064453125
      ],
      "text": "18.\tMycobacterium tuberculosis antigen-based skin tests (TBSTs) may be used to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        284.1444091796875,
        214.09091186523438,
        297.05841064453125
      ],
      "text": "test for TB infection.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        302.51214599609375,
        509.58013916015625,
        315.39312744140625
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation for the intervention, very low certainty of the evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 10.979230880737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.8608093261719,
        148.6093292236328,
        351.9488220214844
      ],
      "text": "Evidence base",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.6158142089844,
        526.9920043945312,
        375.7608337402344
      ],
      "text": "In 2021, WHO commissioned a systematic review of published and unpublished data on the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.1158142089844,
        526.9681396484375,
        391.2608337402344
      ],
      "text": "new class of tests for TB infection not previously reviewed by WHO. The overarching policy",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.6158142089844,
        527.0144653320312,
        406.7608337402344
      ],
      "text": "question was: Should Mtb antigen-based skin tests (TBSTs) for TB infection be used as an",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.1158142089844,
        526.8524169921875,
        422.2608337402344
      ],
      "text": "alternative to the tuberculin skin test (TST) or WHO-endorsed interferon-y release assays (IGRA)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.969256401062012,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.6158142089844,
        526.6707763671875,
        437.7608337402344
      ],
      "text": "to identify individuals most at risk of progression from TB infection to TB disease? Based on the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.986842155456543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.1158142089844,
        527.0640869140625,
        453.2608337402344
      ],
      "text": "ov erarching policy question, four domains for evidence search and generation were included:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991196632385254,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.6158142089844,
        526.9414672851562,
        468.7608337402344
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic accuracy, safety, economic aspects and qualitative aspects. For each domain, specific",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.964542388916016,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.1158142089844,
        524.41162109375,
        484.2608337402344
      ],
      "text": "population, intervention, comparator and outcome (PICO) or research questions were defined.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.976174354553223,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        495.2737121582031,
        527.04052734375,
        508.35272216796875
      ],
      "text": "Domain 1 –  : Do TBSTs have similar or better diagnostic  Diagnostic accuracy (PICO question)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.77374267578125,
        374.8370361328125,
        523.687744140625
      ],
      "text": "performance than the TST or IGRAs to detect TB infection?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        534.777587890625,
        527.201904296875,
        547.8566284179688
      ],
      "text": "Domain 2 –  : Do TBSTs for TB infection cause more adverse reactions than the TST  Safety",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        550.277587890625,
        121.43299865722656,
        563.1915893554688
      ],
      "text": "or IGRAs?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        574.1276245117188,
        78.81909942626953,
        587.2726440429688
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        574.1276245117188,
        495.3768615722656,
        587.2726440429688
      ],
      "text": "What is the risk of adverse events of TBSTs compared with the current TST or IGRAs?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.6276245117188,
        78.81909942626953,
        602.7726440429688
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        589.6276245117188,
        527.151123046875,
        602.7726440429688
      ],
      "text": "Consider data on both local and systemic reactions graded by type, severity and seriousness,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974771499633789,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        605.1276245117188,
        217.4451904296875,
        618.2726440429688
      ],
      "text": "and stratified by subgroup.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        620.6276245117188,
        78.81909942626953,
        633.7726440429688
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        620.6276245117188,
        526.8322143554688,
        633.7726440429688
      ],
      "text": "Compute relative risks where possible; however, if there is no control group receiving a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        636.1276245117188,
        361.8719787597656,
        649.2726440429688
      ],
      "text": "comparator test, report frequency (%) of adverse events.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.1201782226562,
        527.0151977539062,
        676.19921875
      ],
      "text": "Domain 3 : What are economic considerations of TBSTs   – Cost–effectiveness analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.6201782226562,
        245.20330810546875,
        691.5341796875
      ],
      "text": "compared with the TST or IGRAs?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.4700927734375,
        78.81909942626953,
        715.6151123046875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        702.4700927734375,
        325.4002990722656,
        715.6151123046875
      ],
      "text": "How large are the resource requirements (costs)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.9700927734375,
        78.81909942626953,
        731.1151123046875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        717.9700927734375,
        432.79876708984375,
        731.1151123046875
      ],
      "text": "What is the certainty of the evidence on resource requirements (costs)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        733.4700927734375,
        78.81909942626953,
        746.6151123046875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        733.4700927734375,
        524.4103393554688,
        746.6151123046875
      ],
      "text": "Does the cost–effectiveness of the intervention favour the intervention or the comparison?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
